    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d60-a1">

                <pb facs="0120" n="40" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg40"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Ragsdale, United
                        States Consul at Tientsin, to Mr. Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Tientsin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-11-08"><hi rendition="#italic">November 8,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that on
                    yesterday the Russian consul here gave notice to the consuls of the different
                    countries that the land fronting on the Bund, or east bank of the Peiho,
                    extending from (and including) the railroad station to Meyers’ godown, a
                    distance of nearly 2 miles, would be reserved for the use and benefit of the
                    Russian Government.</p>
                <pb facs="0121" n="41" xml:id="pg41"/>
                <p>To-day a like notice was given by the Belgian consul that his Government would
                    reserve the land on the east bank of the river for a distance of about 1 mile
                    below that already claimed by the Russians. The distance back from the river is
                    not given by either claimant. I have asked for a map showing the exact area
                    claimed. If given, I will forward you a copy.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">James W. Ragsdale</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
